    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Challenges Update out NOW!</h1><p>The big <strong>Challenges</strong> update is out now! This update adds single player / co-operative challenges mode to the game, as well as full controller support and fixes a number of bugs. Oh, and some new battle levels and weapons!</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223550/extras/84507368fe7921f74a220b91a67fdb0c.avif?t=1671362738\" /></div><br><br><strong>Buddy Bash</strong> is a physics-based multiplayer 2D platformer arcade game that combines parkour moves and firearms into a cute, yet brutal, cocktail of friendly competitive fun!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHALLENGES!</h2> Complete a number of single player / co-operative challenges<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PHYSICS!</h2> Every fight plays differently while you use momentum to inflict maximum damage on your opponent(s)<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DESTRUCTION!</h2> Bash your opponent into a wall or into the ground hard enough and you'll see them fly through it. Or just use a bazooka.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PARKOUR!</h2> Developed by parkour enthusiasts, the moves of your fighter are inspired by real life parkour movement<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NEON!</h2> Enjoy the visual spectacle of your martial artists in the glow of 80s(tm) inspired neon lights<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">1 TO 4 PLAYERS!</h2> Gather a group of friends on a coach to see who bashes their buddies the best!<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ONLINE!</h2> Play with your online friends using Steam Remote Play!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223550/extras/6dc61a4a0af980e099fde5b34a51d2b3.avif?t=1671362738\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223550/extras/de5ffc91cc9c660e880b1cd12921e7c3.avif?t=1671362738\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223550/extras/84507368fe7921f74a220b91a67fdb0c.avif?t=1671362738\" /></div><br><br><strong>Buddy Bash</strong> is a physics-based multiplayer 2D platformer arcade game that combines parkour moves and firearms into a cute, yet brutal, cocktail of friendly competitive fun!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHALLENGES!</h2> Complete a number of single player / co-operative challenges<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PHYSICS!</h2> Every fight plays differently while you use momentum to inflict maximum damage on your opponent(s)<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DESTRUCTION!</h2> Bash your opponent into a wall or into the ground hard enough and you'll see them fly through it. Or just use a bazooka.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PARKOUR!</h2> Developed by parkour enthusiasts, the moves of your fighter are inspired by real life parkour movement<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NEON!</h2> Enjoy the visual spectacle of your martial artists in the glow of 80s(tm) inspired neon lights<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">1 TO 4 PLAYERS!</h2> Gather a group of friends on a coach to see who bashes their buddies the best!<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ONLINE!</h2> Play with your online friends using Steam Remote Play!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223550/extras/6dc61a4a0af980e099fde5b34a51d2b3.avif?t=1671362738\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223550/extras/de5ffc91cc9c660e880b1cd12921e7c3.avif?t=1671362738\" /></div>",
